{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4f7d9152-e494-8a1d-bea0-11975e0f5833",
  "created_at": "2026-01-02T12:28:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucia Teixeira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:22:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:22:16-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hi. So they skipped us again on the Thursday and I'm trying to find out what the schedule is now, after the holiday week. Nobody told me anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:22:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me get the details. Is this for trash or recycling, or both?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:22:43-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, really. The bins were out Thursday morning like always and they were still full at four o'clock. I run a small shop out of the house, so we have more than a regular household."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:23:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what's the location, so I can look at the right route?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:23:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "46 Ruggles Avenue. That's up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:23:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "46 Ruggles Avenue, Historic Hill. Okay. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:23:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lucia Teixeira. T-E-I-X-E-I-R-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:23:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Lucia. Let me pull up the holiday schedule. Give me just a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:23:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:23:41-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay. So the holiday week pushed collection back a day on a lot of routes. Thursday's pickup would have moved to Friday, which is today, for some streets. Did anything come by this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:24:03-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I left for a bit around nine. I haven't checked since. But nobody said it moved to Friday. I would have put the bins out Friday if I'd known."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:24:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So you're asking what your regular day is going forward, and whether today's pickup still happens."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:24:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Both of those. What's the normal schedule going to be starting next week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:24:41-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "From what I'm seeing, the delay runs through this week, and then routes go back to their regular days starting Monday. So your Thursday goes back to Thursday next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:25:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So next Thursday, the eighth, it's back to normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:25:06-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, Thursday the eighth. Now, for today, I can't see whether your street has been done yet. Crews are still working through the delayed routes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I should put the bins out now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:25:28-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If they're not already at the curb, yes, I'd put them out. If the truck doesn't come by this evening, that's something we'd want to know about."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:25:45-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if it doesn't come, what then? Because I can't have a week of overflow. I have boxes and packing material from the shop on top of the regular trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:26:04-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. That's a question for a supervisor, honestly, whether there's a make-up pass for your street. I can put in a request for one to call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:26:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. I'd like a supervisor to call me back. Today if possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:26:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note it as today. What's the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:26:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0192."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:26:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-two. Is that a landline?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:26:45-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's the house phone. I'm home most of the afternoon. I'm sorting old photographs into albums, so I'm not going anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:26:59-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, then you'll catch the call. I'll write that you're at 46 Ruggles Avenue, missed Thursday pickup, trash and recycling, wants to know about a make-up pass, and wants the revised schedule confirmed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:27:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And the part about the commercial amount, the extra boxes. Can you add that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:27:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll add that you have extra cardboard from a home business. I'd let the supervisor talk through what's allowed with that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:27:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. That works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:27:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else I can do while I have you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:27:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Just the callback. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:27:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Lucia. Someone should reach you this afternoon. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T12:28:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
